harder follow-up questions or vocabulary, then evaluate more classroom evidence before changing placement."}},{"title":{"zh":"低龄组需要更容易表达反馈","en":"Make feedback easier for younger learners"},"evidence":{"zh":"3–5 岁样本 80/111 条待确认（72.1%）。不能把可识别的问题较少理解为体验更好。","en":"80/111 recordings from ages 3–5 remain unresolved (72.1%). Fewer identifiable issues do not establish a better experience."},"action":{"zh":"增加“听不懂 / 没声音 / 卡住了”等图形选项，并支持家长补充说明。","en":"Add visual choices such as “I don’t understand”, “No sound” and “Stuck”, with an option for parent details."}},{"title":{"zh":"把技术线索交给具体排查","en":"Investigate concrete interaction and playback reports"},"evidence":{"zh":"说话未被接住、画面或操作受阻、听不到声音共 35 条。录音只能说明用户遇到的现象，不能单凭它确定设备或网络根因。","en":"35 recordings describe unanswered or misrecognized speech, blocked screens or controls, or missing playback. They establish reported symptoms, not device or network root causes."},"action":{"zh":"结合原课堂事件检查回复等待、识别结果、页面状态和声音播放。","en":"Check response timing, recognition results, page state and playback against the associated classroom events."}}],"examples":[{"theme":{"zh":"听不懂或任务太难","en":"Comprehension or excessive difficulty"},"context":{"zh":"泰国 · L3 · 9–12 岁 · 不确定（用户选择）","en":"Thailand · L3 · 9–12 years · Not sure (selected answer)"},"paraphrase":{"zh":"不知道老师回答了什么，也不知道自己应该怎么回答，希望得到帮助。","en":"The learner does not understand the teacher’s reply and needs help knowing what to say."},"dimensions":{"country":"泰国","level":"3","age":"9–12","ability":"NS"}},{"theme":{"zh":"需要母语、翻译或放慢语速","en":"Language, translation or pace support"},"context":{"zh":"沙特阿拉伯 · L4 · 18+ 岁 · 基础水平","en":"Saudi Arabia · L4 · 18+ years · Basic level"},"paraphrase":{"zh":"只听英语很难理解，希望把阿拉伯语解释和英语一起提供。","en":"English-only instruction is hard to follow; the learner asks for Arabic explanations alongside English."},"dimensions":{"country":"沙特阿拉伯","level":"4","age":"18+","ability":"BL"}},{"theme":{"zh":"说话未被正确接住","en":"Speech not understood or answered"},"context":{"zh":"沙特阿拉伯 · L3 · 9–12 岁 · 可以读说","en":"Saudi Arabia · L3 · 9–12 years · Can read & talk"},"paraphrase":{"zh":"已经按要求说了问候语，老师还是像没有听到一样。","en":"The learner says they already gave the requested greeting, but the teacher still seems not to have heard it."},"dimensions":{"country":"沙特阿拉伯","level":"3","age":"9–12","ability":"RT"}},{"theme":{"zh":"画面、视频或操作卡住","en":"Screen, video or navigation problems"},"context":{"zh":"马来西亚 · L4 · 18+ 岁 · 基础水平","en":"Malaysia · L4 · 18+ years · Basic level"},"paraphrase":{"zh":"视频无法加载。","en":"The learner reports that the video cannot load."},"dimensions":{"country":"马来西亚","level":"4","age":"18+","ability":"BL"}},{"theme":{"zh":"课程太简单","en":"Content is too easy"},"context":{"zh":"韩国 · L3 · 9–12 岁 · 可以读说","en":"Korea · L3 · 9–12 years · Can read & talk"},"paraphrase":{"zh":"当前内容太简单，希望学习更难的词汇。","en":"The learner finds the current material too easy and asks for harder vocabulary."},"dimensions":{"country":"韩国","level":"3","age":"9–12","ability":"RT"}},{"theme":{"zh":"听不懂或任务太难","en":"Comprehension or excessive difficulty"},"context":{"zh":"韩国 · L4 · 18+ 岁 · 基础水平","en":"Korea · L4 · 18+ years · Basic level"},"paraphrase":{"zh":"听不懂课程内容，希望增加韩文字幕。","en":"The learner cannot understand the lesson and asks for Korean subtitles."},"dimensions":{"country":"韩国","level":"4","age":"18+","ability":"BL"}}],"limitations":[{"zh":"共涉及 540 位学生、550 节课；同一学生可以提交多条录音，当前按录音计数。","en":"The sample covers 540 students and 550 classes. A student may submit multiple recordings; counts are per recording."},{"zh":"先在本机自动转写，再逐条依据转写语义归类；识别模糊、静音或可能幻听的内容单列待确认，不能由此推断麦克风或其他故障。","en":"Recordings were transcribed locally and individually categorized from their transcripts. Unclear, silent or potentially hallucinated results remain unresolved and do not establish microphone or other faults."},{"zh":"每条录音仅取一个主要问题；一条包含多个问题时，优先记录首先清楚描述的阻塞。","en":"Each recording receives one primary category; when several issues are stated, the first clearly described blocking issue is used."},{"zh":"问卷里的“不确定”是用户选项，与资料缺失不同。所有缺失画像保留在未知组，不从分母删除。","en":"“Not sure” is a selected questionnaire answer and differs from missing data. Missing profiles remain in an unknown group and stay in the denominator."},{"zh":"年龄与英语能力优先取课堂对应账号的课前入学问卷：758 条有课前年龄、758 条有课前能力；其余年龄来自历史缓存，可能后填。年龄统一显示年龄段，其中 180 条可查单岁年龄。","en":"Age and ability prioritize the associated account’s pre-class onboarding: 758 recordings have pre-class age and 758 have pre-class ability. Remaining ages use historical data that may have been entered later. Age is displayed in bands; exact years are available for 180 recordings."},{"zh":"通过课堂 ID 关联课程与账号。导出学生号和后台内部编号属于不同体系，未取得独立的短号映射；问卷画像是对应账号资料，不能据此声称同账号多孩子已分别核验。","en":"Course and account are linked by exact class ID. Exported student numbers and internal IDs use different systems, with no independent short-ID translation available. Questionnaire profiles belong to the associated account; distinct children sharing an account have not been independently verified."},{"zh":"国家优先沿用课堂事件国家；本次新增识别的录音使用账号安装国家回填，不代表国籍或当前所在地。","en":"Country primarily follows existing classroom event data. Newly identified recordings use the account’s installation country, not nationality or current location."},{"zh":"762 条本次有仓库课堂记录；另 2 条由既有看板确认课程，本次仓库未返回，英语能力保留未知。","en":"762 recordings have classroom records in this lookup. Another 2 retain lesson matches from the existing dashboard because this lookup returned no row; their ability remains unknown."},{"zh":"来源：用户提供的《问题反馈_全部历史_20261014_完整音频地址.xlsx》“问题反馈”表。1,111 条来源中，纳入 764 条 L1–L4 体验课；158 条正式课、175 条其他课、13 条测试账号、1 条无法匹配不进入本分析。","en":"Source: the user-provided feedback workbook, sheet “问题反馈”. Of 1,111 source rows, 764 L1–L4 trial recordings are included; 158 regular lessons, 175 other lessons, 13 test-account recordings and 1 unmatched row are excluded."},{"zh":"国家与自评能力仅作反馈语境。样本量、提交意愿、同一人重复提交和转写可辨程度均会影响比例，不能推断所有学生的问题发生率或因果关系。","en":"Country and self-reported ability provide context only. Sample size, willingness to report, repeat submissions and transcription quality affect the shares; they do not establish incidence or causal differences among all students."},{"zh":"“13+”为问卷未细分年龄，与明确填写的“13–17”和“18+”分开保留；每条录音只归入一个年龄组。","en":"“13+” is an unspecified questionnaire age band, retained separately from explicitly selected “13–17” and “18+”. Each recording belongs to only one age group."}]}